  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut capsicum and carrot into bite sized chunks.\n• Slice zucchini into rounds.\n• Slice red onion into thick wedges.\n• Drain and rinse chickpeas.\n• To a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water to soak.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6784754ef2efe8ce6099163b-72dae9a5.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place veggies and chickpeas on a lined oven tray.\n• Sprinkle with chermoula spice blend, drizzle with olive oil, season with a pinch of salt and toss to coat.\n• Spread out evenly, then roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. Allow to cool slightly. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the veggies between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6784754ef2efe8ce6099163b-d5272ce8.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, chop mini flour tortillas into wedges (see ingredients).\n• While veggies are cooling, spread over a second lined oven tray (don’t worry if they overlap).\n• Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt. Bake until lightly golden and crisp, 8-10 minutes.\n• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side. Transfer to a plate to rest.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6784754ef2efe8ce6099163b-094ee173.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Once the veggies are cooled, in a large bowl, combine roasted veggies, tortilla chips, a drizzle of white wine vinegar and golden goddess dressing. Season to taste.\n• Divide fattoush-style haloumi, chickpea and veggie salad between bowls.\n• Top with yoghurt and sprinkle over fetta cubes to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6784754ef2efe8ce6099163b-f839af13.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
